About the game:

Oh, the gloriously rich and delectable life of a Chocolatier™! Why not become constantly surrounded by mounds of chocolate bars and boxes of mouth-watering truffles? Build your empire one ingredient at a time as you travel the world to find the best prices and buy factories to maximize production. Manage your output and please your customers...but don't forget about those conniving competitors who wish you poorly. Do you have what it takes to conquer the world through chocolate?

